 351+ 93AB                  ; Avanzar indice round-robin
 352+ 93AB 3A B2 81         LD A, (EnemyStepIdx)
 353+ 93AE 3C               INC A
 354+ 93AF FE 09            CP NUM_MONSTERS + NUM_NASTIES
