4148+ A9B9              ; MONSTER SPAWN/REPOSITION SYSTEM (simplified, robust)
4149+ A9B9              ; ==============================================================================
4150+ A9B9              ; ALL monsters ALWAYS appear at LastEntryPosX/Y (player's entry position).
4151+ A9B9              ; This is the ONLY guaranteed safe position (player fits there, 16x21).
4152+ A9B9              ; No nudge, no border scan, no MonsterSave, no buffer restore.
4153+ A9B9              ; ==============================================================================
4154+ A9B9              ; MONSTER SPAWN/REPOSITION SYSTEM (robust, simplified)
4155+ A9B9              ; ==============================================================================
4156+ A9B9              ; ALL monsters ALWAYS appear at LastEntryPosX/Y (player entry position).
4157+ A9B9              ; This is the ONLY guaranteed safe position (player fits 16x21 there).
4158+ A9B9              ; No nudge, no border scan, no MonsterSave, no buffer restore.
4159+ A9B9              ; ==============================================================================
4160+ A9B9              MONSTERS_TO_SPAWN   EQU 3
4161+ A9B9              MONSTER_ENTRY_BASE  EQU 50          ; Frames antes del primer monster (~1s)
4162+ A9B9              MONSTER_ENTRY_GAP   EQU 40          ; Frames entre cada monster (~0.8s)
