 147+ AF10
 148+ AF10              .noEast:
 149+ AF10                  ; --- Comprobar borde NORTE (solo si pulsa N) ---
 150+ AF10 CB 42            BIT 0, D                    ; N
 151+ AF12 CA 60 AF         JP Z, .noNorth
 152+ AF15 3A A2 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSY)
 153+ AF18 FE 14            CP SCREEN_MIN_Y + TRANSITION_ZONE
 154+ AF1A D2 60 AF         JP NC, .noNorth
 155+ AF1D 3A C9 81         LD A, (CurrentScreenY)
 156+ AF20 B7               OR A
 157+ AF21 CA 60 AF         JP Z, .noNorth
 158+ AF24                  ; Check collision at row 0 (left + mid + right del player)
 159+ AF24 3A A1 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
 160+ AF27 47               LD B, A
 161+ AF28 0E 10            LD C, SCREEN_MIN_Y
 162+ AF2A CD 67 B4         CALL IsPointBlocked
 163+ AF2D C2 60 AF         JP NZ, .noNorth
 164+ AF30 3A A1 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
 165+ AF33 C6 07            ADD A, 7
