 167+ AF36 0E 10            LD C, SCREEN_MIN_Y
 168+ AF38 CD 67 B4         CALL IsPointBlocked
 169+ AF3B C2 60 AF         JP NZ, .noNorth
 170+ AF3E 3A A1 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
 171+ AF41 C6 0F            ADD A, 15
