 222+ AFB1              .doTransition:
 223+ AFB1 3A CC 81         LD A, (ScreenTransition)
 224+ AFB4 32 CD 81         LD (LastScreenTransition), A
 225+ AFB7                  ; Guardar posicion del player al entrar (unico punto seguro para monsters)
 226+ AFB7 3A A1 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
 227+ AFBA 32 CE 81         LD (LastEntryPosX), A
 228+ AFBD 3A A2 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSY)
