 457+ DF8E                  ; D < E → marchito (decayed), D >= E → sano (healthy sprite data)
 458+ DF8E 7A               LD A, D
 459+ DF8F BB               CP E
 460+ DF90 30 0B            JR NC, .dbFull
 461+ DF92                  ; Marchito: copiar sprite decayed
 462+ DF92 FD 7E 00         LD A, (IY+0)
